<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $328,000 Arizona tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat 1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-1 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>4-Alberto Costa (Spain) beat Marc-Kevin Gollner (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat 5-Andre Agassi (U.S) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat 6- Alberto Berasategui</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Vincent Spadea (U.S.) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>0-6 6-1</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1.</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Leonardo Lavalle (Mexico) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 3-6 6-3.</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-4 1-6 7-5</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela) 6-4</p>
<p>6-7 (5-7) 6-3.</p>
</text>
